## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = Warskôging: skript reagearret net
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = In skript op dizze side is dwaande, of it reagearret net mear. Jo kinne it skript no ôfbrekke, of jo kinne fierder gean om te sjen oft it skript ôfmakke wurde sil.
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = Skript: { $location }
# The & character marks the access key of the checkbox label.
dom-slow-script-dialog-dont-ask-again = Dit net mear freegje
dom-slow-script-dialog-stop-button = Skript stopje
dom-slow-script-dialog-continue-button = Trochgean
dom-slow-addon-script-dialog-title = Warskôging: add-onskript reagearret net
# Variables:
#   $extensionName (String) - Name of the extension running the script.
dom-slow-addon-script-dialog-message =
    Der wurdt in script fan de útwreiding ‘{ $extensionName }’ op dizze side útfierd, wêrtroch { -brand-short-name } net mear reagearret.
    
    It kin dwaande wêze, of it reagearret hielendal net mear. Jo kinne it script no stopje, of jo kinne trochgean om te sjen oft it foltôge wurde sil.
dom-slow-addon-script-dialog-checkbox = Opkeare dat it útwreidingsscript op dizze side útfierd wurdt oant it opnij laden wurdt
